<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Magnetics cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Magnetics cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it trimmed its 1997 earnings expectations on Applied Magnetics Corp to $3.87 a share from $4.64 a share.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 1998 earnings estimate to $4.69 a share from $6.15 a share.</p>
<p>-- said had been concerned about Applied Magnetic's business in the quarter, &quot;specifically, that APM is having difficulty with its yields related to new products.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Applied lost 2-1/4 to 23-5/8.</p>
</text>
